From 79aa9867faf4c771bb24278e037d3825b8bbb1dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rafi Goldhammer-Baum <rafi@ukbaums.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:58:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove no-std-compat from framework_lib

I was working on packaging framework_tool for Fedora, but packaging
no-std-compat would have been challenging since it has not been updated
since 2020 and has very old dependencies. It's pretty straightforward to
remove it instead.
